  {
    id: "services-detail",
    heading: "Our services for German businesses, in detail",
    paragraphs: [
      "<strong>Web development.</strong> Company websites, product microsites and landing pages built with Astro, Next.js and React, or with WordPress where your marketing team wants to edit content independently. For most German service firms and industrial suppliers we recommend a static site: it is fast, needs little maintenance, has a very small attack surface and can be hosted in the EU for very little. The static plan covers up to 100 pages, responsive layouts, contact forms and deployment. See the <a href=\"/services/web-development/\">web development service page</a> for the technical details.",
      "<strong>Design for German buyers.</strong> German B2B and B2C audiences read more before they contact anyone. They look for specifications, certifications, delivery terms, contact persons with names and clear information about the company. Design therefore prioritises structure and legibility over effects: clean typography, generous tables for technical data, downloadable data sheets, and navigation that makes the Impressum, privacy policy and contact details easy to find from every page.",
