      "<strong>Custom software and web applications.</strong> Customer portals for reorders and documents, product configurators, dealer and partner portals, internal dashboards, booking tools and admin panels. Typical German examples: a machine builder that wants customers to find spare parts by serial number, a Handwerk business that needs appointment scheduling and job documentation, or a B2B wholesaler that wants customer-specific price lists online.",
