      { name: "North Rhine-Westphalia: Cologne, Düsseldorf and the Ruhr", text: "North Rhine-Westphalia is Germany's most populous state. Cologne is strong in media, insurance and trade fairs; Düsseldorf in fashion, advertising, telecommunications and consulting, with a notable Japanese business community; and the Ruhr region in energy, logistics, chemicals and a transforming industrial base. The sheer number of mid-sized firms makes NRW a large market for B2B websites, dealer portals, ERP-connected shops and multilingual sites for export business." },
