      { name: "Saxony: Leipzig and Dresden", text: "Saxony has grown into a significant technology region. Dresden is the centre of Silicon Saxony, Europe's largest microelectronics cluster, while Leipzig has become a logistics hub and a lively location for startups, media and trade fairs. Tech companies here need recruiting sites that attract international talent, clear product and research pages, and fast-moving marketing sites; logistics and trade businesses need quote and tracking tools." },
      { name: "The rest of Germany", text: "We work equally with companies in Lower Saxony, Bremen, Schleswig-Holstein, Rhineland-Palatinate, Saarland, Thuringia, Saxony-Anhalt, Brandenburg and Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania. Across the country the same principles apply: structure content for careful readers, make legal information easy to find, respect data protection, and build fast sites that work well on phones as well as office desktops." },
    ],
    after: [
      "The region table further down summarises these patterns. None of these locations are offices; they are markets we serve remotely.",
