      "Our working day of 9 am to 9 pm IST starts before German offices open and ends in the German late afternoon. That has a useful effect: we can read messages you sent the previous evening and deliver changes before your day begins, then be available live during your morning and early afternoon for calls, reviews and acceptance tests. Late German afternoon meetings, after 4:30 pm in winter, are the only slot that needs special arrangement.",
